### Signup
### Create new user
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "johndoe",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "role": "buyer"
}


### signin
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "johndoe",
  "password": "SecurePass123!"
}